{"id":773198,"title":"40｜发布到微信客服","content":"将机器人发布到微信客服需先完成企业认证，费用为每年300元。未认证无法绑定机器人。发布步骤包括：点击发布，选择微信客服配置，输入从微信客服平台获取的企业ID；接着填写token和encoding AES key，这些信息同样来自微信客服后台；配置webhook地址至微信客服回调设置中；最后，在代码界面填写企业secret和客服账号名称，确保与微信客服后台一致。完成配置后，状态显示为已配置，勾选并发布。通过微信客户端可测试机器人功能，如查询课程信息、处理错误代码及图片等。目前，微信客服与机器人的交互不支持异步消息，图片解析则能提供相应解答。尽管图片链接需手动打开查看，但整体对接流程简便。强调再次，企业认证是使用该服务的前提条件。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":391843,"user_name":"zhihai.tu","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1045888,"ip_address":"俄罗斯","ucode":"61371EA3EF6988","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/f5/80/baddf03b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1719247487,"is_pvip":true,"replies":[{"id":142505,"content":"抱歉，后面会再加餐一个图片流的内容。\n但是本课程内不会加餐API的内容了。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1224950,"ctime":1719754691,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":391843,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100760301,"comment_content":"老师，目前Coze已经支持发布至API，能否加餐讲一下如何将机器人发布至个人微信。","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1224950,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/12/b0/f6/eb6a8f61.jpg","nickname":"郭旭","note":"","ucode":"7CC6787BD0F0A9","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":647264,"discussion_content":"抱歉，后面会再加餐一个图片流的内容。\n但是本课程内不会加餐API的内容了。","content_length":37,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1719754692,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":390548,"user_name":"Geek_a6abfa","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3887439,"ip_address":"安徽","ucode":"26BDFC86C27832","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime"